@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title CpgGnn embedding architecture (feature "gnn")
component "Node initialisation\n16-dim kind one-hot + random init" as Init #DBE4FF
component "Message-passing layer\n(x num_layers, default 3)\nmean(AST + CFG + DFG neighbours) -> ReLU" as MP #FCC2D7
component "Node embeddings\ndim = embedding_dim (default 128)" as Emb #FCC2D7
component "Subgraph embedding\nMean / Sum / Max aggregation" as Sub #FCC2D7
Init --> MP
MP --> Emb
Emb --> Sub
note right of MP
  propagate(iterations) owns the
  CodePropertyGraph and aggregates over
  AST (children + parent), CFG (succ + pred),
  and DFG (succ + pred) neighbourhoods.
end note
legend right
  |= colour |= concept |
  |<#DBE4FF>| input features |
  |<#FCC2D7>| GNN / embedding |
endlegend
@enduml
